### 6. `internal/api/graphql/storyboard_resolver.go`

Two new resolver methods must be added to `StoryboardResolver` to wire the new mutations to the service layer.

**a) Update the `domain.StoryboardService` interface comment** at the bottom of the file to document the two new methods (this is the inline documentation block at line 291–299):

